# Never apply line-ending conversion to these. A PDF made by a generator can contain
# no NUL bytes at all, so Git's "looks like text" heuristic misfires and it would
# rewrite LF to CRLF on checkout — which corrupts the file's byte offsets.
*.pdf   binary
*.webp  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
